<title>USA: Thermedics,Thermo file shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Thermedics,Thermo file shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermedics Inc and Thermo Instrument Systems Inc said Friday they filed a shelf registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for stock or debt offerings of up to $250 million each.</p>
<p>Thermo Electron Corp, which owns 82 percent of Thermo's Instrument's oustanding stock and 58 percent of Thermedics', is expected to guarantee the payment on debt securities issued by the companies, a statement said.</p>
</text>
